# Gameplay movement is remapped at CONSUMPTION time, not here:
# Defold compiles this file into the build and has no runtime API to
# change it, so each physical key gets its own raw action name and
# main/core/input_bindings.lua decides what that key currently means.
# See that module's header for why only movement works this way.
#
# R, ESC and ENTER keep semantic action names at the bottom of this
# file: restart is broadcast to every restorable object in a level, and
# menu keys must stay fixed so a bad remap can never lock a player out
# of the screen that would let them fix it.
